---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
---

<MainLayout 
  title="Selected Work"
  description="Case studies from recent projects including robotic mission orchestration and Saudi government digital platform architecture."
>
  <div class="py-16 bg-white dark:bg-gray-900">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
        <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-4">Selected Work</h1>
        <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 mb-12">
          Architecture highlights from recent enterprise and government platforms
        </p>
        
        <div class="space-y-12">
          <!-- Nebula -->
          <article class="bg-gradient-to-br from-accent-50 to-blue-50 dark:from-accent-900/20 dark:to-blue-900/20 rounded-xl overflow-hidden">
            <div class="p-8 md:p-10">
              <div class="flex items-start justify-between mb-4">
                <div>
                  <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-2 text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Nebula</h2>
                  <p class="text-lg text-accent-700 dark:text-accent-300">Robotic Workflow & Mission Orchestration Platform</p>
                </div>
                <span class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 whitespace-nowrap ml-4">Oct 2025 – Present</span>
              </div>
              
              <p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 mb-6 text-lg">
                Event-driven robotic mission platform enabling n8n-style design, test, and execute workflows across heterogeneous robot fleets
              </p>
              
              <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mb-8">
                <div>
                  <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-3">Architecture Highlights</h3>
                  <ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
                    <li class="flex items-start">
                      <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-accent-600 dark:text-accent-400 mt-0.5 mr-2 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
                      </svg>
                      <span>Distributed NestJS microservices with Kafka event streaming</span>
                    </li>
                    <li class="flex items-start">
                      <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-accent-600 dark:text-accent-400 mt-0.5 mr-2 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
                      </svg>
                      <span>Mission Orchestrator with generic DAG execution engine</span>
                    </li>
                    <li class="flex items-start">
                      <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-accent-600 dark:text-accent-400 mt-0.5 mr-2 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
                      </svg>
                      <span>Temporal workflow orchestration for resilient execution</span>
                    </li>
                    <li class="flex items-start">
                      <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-accent-600 dark:text-accent-400 mt-0.5 mr-2 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
                      </svg>
                      <span>Debezium CDC and Flink for event stream processing</span>
                    </li>
                  </ul>
                </div>
                
                <div>
                  <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-3">Key Achievements</h3>
                  <ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
                    <li class="flex items-start">
                      <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-accent-600 dark:text-accent-400 mt-0.5 mr-2 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z" />
                      </svg>
                      <span>Node-type dispatch with I/O propagation across mission steps</span>
                    </li>
                    <li class="flex items-start">
                      <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-accent-600 dark:text-accent-400 mt-0.5 mr-2 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z" />
                      </svg>
                      <span>Hybrid E2E testing with Docker Compose and infrastructure probes</span>
                    </li>
                    <li class="flex items-start">
                      <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-accent-600 dark:text-accent-400 mt-0.5 mr-2 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z" />
                      </svg>
                      <span>Shared OpenAPI/Orval/Zod contracts preventing integration drift</span>
                    </li>
                    <li class="flex items-start">
                      <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-accent-600 dark:text-accent-400 mt-0.5 mr-2 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z" />
                      </svg>
                      <span>LiveKit camera streaming and KONE elevator integration</span>
                    </li>
                  </ul>
                </div>
              </div>
              
              <div class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-800/50 rounded-lg p-6">
                <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-3">Technology Stack</h3>
                <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
                  {["NestJS", "TypeScript", "Kafka", "RabbitMQ", "Temporal", "Debezium", "Flink", "PostgreSQL", "Redis", "QuestDB", "Prisma", "React", "MQTT", "LiveKit", "OpenAPI", "Docker", "Jest"].map(tech => (
                    <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-accent-100 text-accent-700 dark:bg-accent-900/30 dark:text-accent-300 rounded-full text-sm font-medium">
                      {tech}
                    </span>
                  ))}
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </article>
          
          <!-- Al-Jouf -->
          <article class="bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-50 to-indigo-50 dark:from-purple-900/20 dark:to-indigo-900/20 rounded-xl overflow-hidden">
            <div class="p-8 md:p-10">
              <div class="flex items-start justify-between mb-4">
                <div>
                  <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-2 text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Strategic Office for Al-Jouf Region</h2>
                  <p class="text-lg text-purple-700 dark:text-purple-300">Saudi Government Digital Platform</p>
                </div>
                <span class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 whitespace-nowrap ml-4">Nov 2024 – Sept 2025</span>
              </div>
              
              <p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 mb-6 text-lg">
                Monorepo digital government platform delivering bilingual citizen services, e-services, CMS, and identity management on on-premises Kubernetes
              </p>
              
              <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mb-8">
                <div>
                  <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-3">Architecture Highlights</h3>
                  <ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
                    <li class="flex items-start">
                      <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-400 mt-0.5 mr-2 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
                      </svg>
                      <span>Monorepo platform with .NET microservices + Next.js</span>
                    </li>
                    <li class="flex items-start">
                      <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-400 mt-0.5 mr-2 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
                      </svg>
                      <span>On-premises Kubernetes deployment architecture</span>
                    </li>
                    <li class="flex items-start">
                      <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-400 mt-0.5 mr-2 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
                      </svg>
                      <span>Camunda BPMN workflow engine for e-service approvals</span>
                    </li>
                    <li class="flex items-start">
                      <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-400 mt-0.5 mr-2 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
                      </svg>
                      <span>Nafath + Keycloak identity federation</span>
                    </li>
                  </ul>
                </div>
                
                <div>
                  <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-3">Key Achievements</h3>
                  <ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
                    <li class="flex items-start">
                      <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-400 mt-0.5 mr-2 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z" />
                      </svg>
                      <span>Bilingual AR/EN portal with RTL/LTR support</span>
                    </li>
                    <li class="flex items-start">
                      <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-400 mt-0.5 mr-2 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z" />
                      </svg>
                      <span>WCAG 2.1 AA accessibility compliance</span>
                    </li>
                    <li class="flex items-start">
                      <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-400 mt-0.5 mr-2 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z" />
                      </svg>
                      <span>Integrated CMS, search, notifications, reporting, audit</span>
                    </li>
                    <li class="flex items-start">
                      <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-400 mt-0.5 mr-2 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z" />
                      </svg>
                      <span>Antivirus and AI chatbot integration</span>
                    </li>
                  </ul>
                </div>
              </div>
              
              <div class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-800/50 rounded-lg p-6">
                <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-3">Technology Stack</h3>
                <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
                  {[".NET", "Next.js", "Kubernetes", "Camunda", "Orchard Core CMS", "Nafath", "Keycloak", "PostgreSQL", "Elasticsearch", "Docker", "CI/CD"].map(tech => (
                    <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-purple-100 text-purple-700 dark:bg-purple-900/30 dark:text-purple-300 rounded-full text-sm font-medium">
                      {tech}
                    </span>
                  ))}
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </article>
          
          <!-- Additional Projects Summary -->
          <div class="bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-800/50 rounded-xl p-8">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-6 text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Additional Recent Projects</h2>
            
            <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
              <div class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-900/50 rounded-lg p-6">
                <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-2 text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Scenne</h3>
                <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 mb-3">Video-Sharing / Social MVP</p>
                <p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 text-sm">
                  Node.js microservices platform with social graph, Redis caching, RabbitMQ orchestration, and AWS S3/Lambda video processing pipeline
                </p>
              </div>
              
              <div class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-900/50 rounded-lg p-6">
                <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-2 text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Blue Cross of Idaho</h3>
                <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 mb-3">Healthcare Data Pipeline</p>
                <p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 text-sm">
                  Enterprise clinical data pipeline ingesting CDEs/CCD/ADT via AWS Glue, Kafka MSK streaming to Snowflake for analytics-ready BI
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-800 text-center">
          <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 mb-6">
            Interested in my full professional background?
          </p>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4">
            <a
              href="/nitesh-portfolio/experience"
              class="inline-flex items-center px-6 py-3 bg-accent-600 hover:bg-accent-700 text-white font-medium rounded-lg transition-colors"
            >
              View Full Experience
            </a>
            <a
              href="/nitesh-portfolio/resume"
              class="inline-flex items-center px-6 py-3 bg-gray-100 dark:bg-gray-800 hover:bg-gray-200 dark:hover:bg-gray-700 text-gray-900 dark:text-white font-medium rounded-lg transition-colors"
            >
              Download Resume
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</MainLayout>
